Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 01:48:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [FIX] Module switching: keep the account role, switch only
 the module; POS for MANAGER/STAFF after CASHIER removal

- Switch Module no longer rewrites activeRole (a STAFF/ADMIN became MANAGER)
- New utils/roleAccess.js: POS_ROLES, DASHBOARD_ROLES, activeModule
- Route guards use trueRole; NavigationManager only redirects across modules
- Old saved sessions are converted; roles with no module are logged out
- ManageAccountsPage read a localStorage key that never existed
- DashboardLayout outlet context was always undefined

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016em7UmD4jX1JzzLu7RZteR
